# Line endings for every project in the photo repository: LF in the repository and on disk,
# on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says, so every clone, worktree and CI run holds the
# same bytes. A project's own .gitattributes refines this baseline. Why: ClaudeCodeStarterKit,
# docs/decisions/0014.
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe misreads labels in batch files with LF endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Binary: never converted.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.fit binary
*.fits binary
*.fts binary
*.nef binary
*.NEF binary
